{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act52side", "eventName": "昨日海", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "YW-5", "avgTag": "行动前", "storyName": "三岔路口", "storyInfo": "奥卢斯阴谋初露，纳乔救下的一位岛民变为海嗣。卡门与克莱门莎同步信息，告知她船厂才是对打捞计划真正重要的地方。纳乔向审判庭自首。", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g14_ibchurch_2", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$ponder_intro", "key": "$ponder_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "posfrom": "-180,-10", "posto": "-90,-10", "duration": 1.2, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 1.0, "posfrom": "-90,-10", "posto": "0,-10", "duration": 1.2, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 1.0, "posfrom": "0,-10", "posto": "0,-30", "duration": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_runstop", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "action": "shake", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 1.0, "power": 1.0, "times": 15.0, "duration": 0.3}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 1.0, "posfrom": "-0,-30", "posto": "0,0", "duration": 1.2, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呼……除了被审判庭带走的人，剩下的都在这里了。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 22, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "谢、谢谢……", "name": "重伤的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 24, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你一个人，救了十四个重伤的同胞？还是背着他们从水路走的……简直是奇迹……", "name": "焦急的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "奇迹……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我只是不想看着同胞被落在外面流血而死。为了不被审判庭的人逮捕，很多人躲得很隐蔽。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 30, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "索莱达，我找到你的时候，你腿上的伤看着很重，止血了吗？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "奥卢斯先生已经帮我处理过了，倒是你……", "name": "焦急的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 34, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉以前就念叨着你手臂伤得很重根本不适宜下水，现在你不光下了水，还一趟一趟地带了这么多人回来……你也找他处理一下吧？", "name": "焦急的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 35, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 1.0, "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-20,0", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 40, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "疲惫的年轻人躲开了同伴触碰自己的手，就像是害怕自己会伤害她一样。"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不用担心，索莱达。我的手臂，已经找奥卢斯先生治疗过了。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1"}, {"id": 44, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g3_seasidest_d", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "keep": "true", "initamount": 0.0, "amount": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 4.0, "keep": "true", "initamount": 1.0, "amount": 0.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不论你如何选择，纳乔，我向你保证，我都可以治好你的手臂。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "治好我的手臂……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "奥卢斯先生，互助会的大家已经没办法回头了，是吗？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你可以试着说服他们，但会很难。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 63, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我明白。我曾无数次劝说鲁菲纳奶奶不要再做危险的事，可她还是会在夜晚离开。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1"}, {"id": 65, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "奶奶做的事，阿奎拉做的事，在我看来依然是偏激的。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1"}, {"id": 67, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但在加入互助会之后我理解了一件事——我永远是岛民中的一员。我想帮他们，可以我现在的状况……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 69, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "奥卢斯先生，您确实能治好我的手吗？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1"}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好孩子。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 73, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我的治疗方式有些特殊，如果你想好了，就跟我来吧。要是治疗过程中感到不适应，你也可以拒绝。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#7$1"}, {"id": 75, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 2.0, "fillfrom": 0.15, "fillto": 0.15, "grad": "true", "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 6.0, "fillfrom": 0.55, "fillto": 0.55, "grad": "true", "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "74_i05", "screenadapt": "coverall", "xScale": 1.25, "yScale": 1.25, "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"yTo": 10.0, "duration": 15.0, "xScaleFrom": 1.25, "yScaleFrom": 1.25, "xScaleTo": 1.4, "yScaleTo": 1.4, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$monastery_sad_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "或许是因为阿奎拉的死让纳乔想起了鲁菲纳奶奶，或许是因为互助会的同胞露出的狂热令他躁动也令他担忧。"}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "即便从眼前这个温柔的男人身上感受到了危险的气息，他还是毅然决然地将自己的伤痛交予对方处理。此时他脑中只有一个想法——"}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他不能让同胞们都怀着仇恨和遗憾死去，他想用一双健全的手臂拦住他们或者救下他们，只要奥卢斯能做到，他愿意付出代价。"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_seaborn_wiggle", "volume": 0.0, "channel": "f", "loop": "true"}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 1.0, "channel": "f", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "黏滑的声音传入他的耳朵，他死死盯着工坊的暗处，一个影子悄然立在不远处。它缓慢地、怪异地朝自己靠近。"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "f", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那是……", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 2.0, "fillfrom": 0.55, "fillto": 0.55, "grad": "true", "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 6.0, "fillfrom": 0.15, "fillto": 0.15, "grad": "true", "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "74_i05", "screenadapt": "coverall", "xScale": 1.2, "yScale": 1.2, "x": 80.0, "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"yTo": 50.0, "duration": 15.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘘——", "name": "奥卢斯"}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你一定会害怕，它就是审判庭写在经卷里的罪孽和怪物，就是你们不被允许靠近大海的唯一原因。", "name": "奥卢斯"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但放心，这个个体……它是我最满意的作品，是我几十年来所有研究成果的具象显现。", "name": "奥卢斯"}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "它不会愤怒、不会争吵、不会流泪、不会施暴，也不会试图把你变成它的同伴。", "name": "奥卢斯"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我篡改了它神经信号的传递逻辑，使它不那么容易受“初生”意志的影响。它还保留着同化其他生物的能力，但不再有那么做的动机。", "name": "奥卢斯"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "当然，“初生”的意志是刻在基因里的，它还是会顽强地试图制造新的神经组织，来替换被我动过手脚的那些……", "name": "奥卢斯"}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但只要勤加干预，进程就不会那么快。", "name": "奥卢斯"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果你怀疑我的言辞，我们随时可以终止手术。海嗣是凶残的、无法沟通的怪物，这是伊比利亚人的共识——", "name": "奥卢斯"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，我可以理解。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "74_i05", "screenadapt": "coverall", "xScale": 1.05, "yScale": 1.05, "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleFrom": 1.2, "yScaleFrom": 1.2, "xScaleTo": 1.0, "yScaleTo": 1.0, "duration": 20.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦？", "name": "奥卢斯"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我也花了近二十年想向伊比利亚人证明，岛民是无害的，是没有攻击性的……但我的努力还不够，我能做到的太少了。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "请继续手术吧，奥卢斯先生。我总不能在寻求帮助的途中再晕倒一次了。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "柔滑的触手攀上纳乔的指尖，本不该有太多触感的假肢正在颤抖。"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他见过捕鳞人被恐鱼袭击的惨状，他竭力控制着自己不要抽回手，然后——"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "疼痛真的消失了。"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g7_alsatelier", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_seabornactivity_1"}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1388_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "action": "shake", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 1.0, "power": 3.0, "times": 30.0, "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（欣快地翕动薄膜）", "name": "海嗣"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1388_1#1$1"}, {"id": 145, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 147, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "令人赞叹，纳乔，你比我想象中更加镇定。你在无人点拨的情况下，理解了分享的本质。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 149, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "分享……奥卢斯先生，您与海嗣为伍，但又不像是癫狂的异教徒，您想要的究竟是什么？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想要的，是一个真正的“理想国”。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#7$1"}, {"id": 153, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$flashback", "volume": 0.8}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 255.0, "g": 255.0, "b": 255.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 255.0, "g": 255.0, "b": 255.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g14_ibchurch_2", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "amount": 0.0, "keep": "true"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 164, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "纳乔，帮我把绷带再扎紧一点。", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 166, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不能再紧了，盖乌斯，勒得再紧止血效果也不会变好，只会让你疼。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 168, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但这样就能盖过伤口的疼了。我们的行动不能到此为止……", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 170, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你在说什么？现在互助会半数的同胞被审判庭逮捕，街道上巡逻的惩戒军只增不减，我们还有不少伤员，停手吧！", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 173, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "参与行动前我们每个人都立过誓，要让伊比利亚记住我们，要让审判庭和那群羞辱过我们的伊比利亚人后悔。", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "岛民不是审判庭召之即来挥之即去的工具，我们要让所有伊比利亚人对我们感到恐惧，然后再赢得尊重。", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "还没有到停手的时候……嘶……*伊比利亚粗口*站起来啊盖乌斯，站起来！", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 177, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$ponder_intro", "key": "$ponder_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1", "duration": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "盖乌斯，冷静一些。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 183, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "奥卢斯先生，您劝劝他们吧！", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 185, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "同胞们，不甘和怨恨让你们的伤口血流不止，这是你们必须承担的代价，也是警告。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 187, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "导师，您了解我们每个人的情况，您知道我们究竟为何反抗。", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我的孩子被伊比利亚人摔死在干涸的井里，他们想借此平息大海的怒火，增加鳞获……但他们换来的是我的怒火。", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 190, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "除了我和妻子安赫拉，谁还会记得这桩恶行，记得我们无辜的孩子？", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哪怕我失去双腿，我也会敲响仇人的家门；哪怕我失去声音，我也会宣扬他们的恶行！", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这是你的选择？", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 194, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的。", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也是你们的选择？", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 198, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的。", "name": "愤怒的岛民们"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 200, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 202, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "奥卢斯先生……？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 205, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.5, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_illusionmagic", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_signalInterference", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.8, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g7_alsatelier", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_bat_act17side_03_intro", "key": "$m_bat_act17side_03_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "教堂怎么变成了……", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "教堂是善意的伪装，也是避免审判庭找到互助会的手段。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 220, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "现在，信仰无法解决你的问题，我的同胞，而任何选择都需要付出代价。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 222, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我可以治好你身体的疼痛，甚至让你遗忘所有经受过的折磨，只要你愿意分享。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 224, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "分享？", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 226, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_seabornactivity_1"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1388_1#1$1", "duration": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这是什么？！是海里的怪物！导师……不，你是深海教会的人！", "name": "惊慌的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 233, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不要那么紧张，它不会伤害你们，我也不会。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 235, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "盖乌斯，离那个东西远一点，它会把你吃得什么都不剩！我见过一次……见过一次……", "name": "惊慌的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 237, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "它可以让我重新站起来，去做更多的事，对吗？", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 239, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的。但这样，恐怕你以后就很难再去见你的妻子了。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#7$1"}, {"id": 241, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在她眼里，孩子死去的那一刻，我也就死了。", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#7$1"}, {"id": 243, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "BackgroundTween", "attributes": {"image": "74_g7_alsatelier", "duration": 20.0, "xScaleTo": 1.18, "yScaleTo": 1.18, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一只唐突出现在工坊中的海嗣，一个已经做好决定的阿戈尔人。他们在惊恐、担忧、愤怒、悲哀的人群中，注视着彼此。"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "冷峻严肃的男人绷紧嘴唇，握紧了拳头，努力克制自己颤抖的身体，靠近那只怪物，但房间中的每一个人都清楚，他也在害怕。"}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Chaos", "from": "chaos_none", "to": "chaos_normal", "fadetime": 3.0, "keep": "true"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就在海嗣触碰男人的一瞬间，他紧绷的身体放松了。他的目光空茫，脸上却露出了笑意，他眼前似乎出现了只有他才能看到的景象。"}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0, "type": "bg", "from": 0.0, "to": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5, "xstrength": 15.0, "ystrength": 15.0, "vibrato": 20.0, "randomness": 70.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他流下了眼泪，他伸出染血的双臂拥抱了眼前的怪物——就像拥抱自己再也无法拥抱的孩子。"}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_signalInterference", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1", "posfrom": "0,-50", "posto": "0,-50", "glitch": "true", "matname": "glitch_none", "duration": 0.8}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_seabornactivity_1"}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "glitchtween", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "glitchto": "bluescreen_middle", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_signalInterference", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.9, "r": 0.2, "g": 0.2, "b": 0.8, "fadetime": 0.1, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1388_1#1$1", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "0,0", "glitch": "true", "matname": "bluescreen_middle"}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.2, "g": 0.2, "b": 0.8, "fadetime": 0.15, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.9, "r": 0.2, "g": 0.2, "b": 0.8, "fadetime": 0.1, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1", "posfrom": "0,-50", "posto": "0,-50", "glitch": "true", "matname": "bluescreen_strong"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.2, "g": 0.2, "b": 0.8, "fadetime": 0.15, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.9, "r": 0.2, "g": 0.2, "b": 0.8, "fadetime": 0.1, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1388_1#1$1", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "0,0", "glitch": "true", "matname": "bluescreen_strong"}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.2, "g": 0.2, "b": 0.8, "fadetime": 0.15, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.9, "r": 0.2, "g": 0.2, "b": 0.8, "fadetime": 0.1, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1", "posfrom": "0,-50", "posto": "0,-50", "glitch": "true", "matname": "bluescreen_strong"}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.2, "g": 0.2, "b": 0.8, "fadetime": 0.15, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1", "glitch": "true", "matname": "bluescreen_strong", "action": "zoom", "poszoom": "0.5,0.5", "scale": 0.95, "duration": 2.0}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 2.0}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_seabornactivity_intense"}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5, "name": "avg_npc_1388_1#1$1", "glitch": "true", "matname": "bluescreen_strong"}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1388_1#1$1", "glitch": "true", "matname": "bluescreen_strong", "action": "zoom", "poszoom": "0.5,0.5", "scale": 1.2, "duration": 2.5}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "glitchtween", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "glitchto": "glitch_none", "duration": 2.0}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "action": "shake", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 1.0, "power": 1.5, "times": 60.0, "duration": 2.0}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "“盖乌斯”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1388_1#1$1"}, {"id": 291, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不对……这不对！你明明说手术是无害的，我明明也还没事，为什么盖乌斯他——", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#5$1"}, {"id": 294, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他依旧是你们的同胞，而且现在他可以站起来，完成他想做的事。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 296, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果你们也不想因为伤病就止步于此，我可以提供帮助。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 298, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不想变成这样……我只是想在这片土地上过得更好一点，而不是……", "name": "惊慌的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 300, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就是因为这些怪物我们才会被伊比利亚人唾弃，被视为灾祸的根源！我不能、我不能跟这种东西……", "name": "恐惧的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 301, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你们都忘了自己加入互助会最初的目标了吗！我们要让审判庭、让伊比利亚人正视我们的处境，无论用什么方法！", "name": "坚定的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 302, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "每个人的选择不同，只有理念相同的人才能结伴而行。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#7$1"}, {"id": 304, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "盖乌斯与你索求的不同，手术的结果也就不同。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 306, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我以为你会帮我们，但不是以这种方式……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#5$1"}, {"id": 308, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我会尊重每个人的意愿，纳乔。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 310, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 312, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我要离开这里。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1"}, {"id": 314, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "当然可以，这里的大门永远为每一位疑惑、困苦、向往和平的阿戈尔人打开。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 316, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你可以去做你想做的，任何事。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 318, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1"}, {"id": 320, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "150,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 0.0, "type": "bg", "from": 1.0, "to": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Chaos", "fadetime": 0.0, "amount": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g1_cmoffice", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 333, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$darkness_03_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 337, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "针对袭击案的收尾工作仍在进行，灯塔供能矩阵还需要时间修复，但民众的惶恐已经逐渐平息。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 339, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我应当感谢你，克莱门莎监事，你为我们找到了遇袭灯塔的位置，避免了诸多损失。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#8$1"}, {"id": 341, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "作为打捞中心的负责人，这是我该做的。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1"}, {"id": 343, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "况且，您与我都清楚，打捞计划真正的核心，并不在于灯塔。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1"}, {"id": 345, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "三十七支守塔队伍，让供能灯塔的重要性不言自明，意图破坏打捞计划的不轨之徒，自然也会将它们视作目标。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 347, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 348, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没有人会意识到一座用来打捞、修复船骸的造船厂，才是计划的核心。港都的中控室，就在那里。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#9$1"}, {"id": 349, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 350, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "导航、动力、通讯——港都作为移动城市的几乎所有功能，都由那里控制。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#9$1"}, {"id": 351, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 352, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "其中最重要的，是一套维系着整个黄金时代几乎所有航海活动的庞大海图系统。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 353, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "它记载着伊比利亚国土上存在过的每一座城镇、每一个港口，也记载着一代代水手在海上发现的每一个岛屿、每一处鳞场。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 354, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而如今，审判庭偌大的档案库中，甚至都找不出一张精确、完整的伊比利亚地图。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 356, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "当初岛民带上岸的蓝本，应该已经包含了阿戈尔海图系统的大部分功能。它理应可以接收城市和设施发出的信号，实时标记它们的位置。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 358, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 359, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "几天后，当港都的中心城区被打捞上岸，它的坐标会在伊比利亚和阿戈尔的海图系统上同时亮起。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 360, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是。而在岛民密谋袭击之前，船厂已经接手了能够解除系统权限封锁、重新启动海图的那把“钥匙”——", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 362, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 363, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一只属于过去的海嗣。它会留在船厂，凭它体内的炼金术式，维系港都的所有城市功能正常运作。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 364, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 365, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……至少，在我们能够重构港都的所有系统和功能之前。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 366, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 367, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以，您广招船工和制帆匠是为了掩人耳目，让斐戴拉大审判官进驻船厂则是另一重保障。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 368, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 369, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在灯塔遇袭，审判庭全体出动的时候，她带着自己的队伍坚守船厂。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 370, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "服从命令是士兵的天职，但我也清楚，看着同僚行动自己却无法支援的感受，对她来说或许很煎熬。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1"}, {"id": 372, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我了解我的学生，她对审判庭过分忠诚。在一切尘埃落定之前，她不会知道自己接手的是什么。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 374, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 375, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等雷亚-伊比利亚正式恢复使用后，我会向审判庭成员宣布灯火的真相。有朝一日，他们会需要重新用自己的意志点燃灯火。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#7$1"}, {"id": 376, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 377, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这不会容易。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 378, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 379, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "现在，克莱门莎监事，尽管我们还需调查岛民袭击行动背后的原因，追查真正的煽动者……", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 380, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 381, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但打捞工程确确实实又推进了一步，我们都可以暂时松一口气了。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#8$1"}, {"id": 382, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 383, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但愿如此。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 384, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 385, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 386, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 387, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$doorknockquite"}}, {"id": 388, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 389, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 390, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1", "posfrom": "-150,0", "posto": "0,0", "duration": 1.2}}, {"id": 391, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.2}}, {"id": 392, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "圣徒阁下，克莱门莎监事。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 393, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 394, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "据岗哨消息，一名自称参与了灯塔袭击的岛民出现在海边。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 395, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 396, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他想向审判庭……自首。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1"}, {"id": 397, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 398, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 399, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 400, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 401, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "32_RL2_cliffday", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 402, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 403, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 404, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_sea", "volume": 0.0, "channel": "f", "loop": "true"}}, {"id": 405, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 1.0, "channel": "f", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 406, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 407, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$loneliness_intro", "key": "$loneliness_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 408, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "岸边黑色的石滩上，海风凄厉。"}}, {"id": 409, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "最早，他从这里爬上岸时，站在岸边迎接的是他的奶奶。奶奶总是走得很快，他只能踉跄地跟在后面，回答奶奶无休无止的问话。"}}, {"id": 410, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "后来，是阿奎拉。阿奎拉会把毛巾裹在他身上，然后两个人在石滩上深一脚浅一脚地往回走，谁也不说一句话。"}}, {"id": 411, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而现在，他数不清在此迎接他的是多少惩戒军的士兵。他们的长戟整整齐齐地指向他，映出的寒光刺得他睁不开眼。"}}, {"id": 412, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那之中，当然也有他熟悉的那个身影。"}}, {"id": 413, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 414, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1", "duration": 0.8}}, {"id": 415, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 416, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "纳乔……", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1"}, {"id": 417, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 418, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，克莱门莎监事，最近我落下了太多工作。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 419, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 420, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "审判庭的长官们，我自认参与了灯塔袭击。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 421, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只要各位长官能答应我的诉求，我会交代我所知道的一切。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 422, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 423, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 424, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 425, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 426, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "f", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 427, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 428, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 429, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}